---
source: crates/frame-graph/src/describe.rs
expression: described(&graph)
---
batch 0 on graphics
  group 0
    barrier all memory: fragment-shader-read -> compute-shader-write
    pass "cull lights" (compute)
  group 1
    barrier output: acquired -> color-attachment-write
    barrier all memory: compute-shader-write -> fragment-shader-read
    pass "shade" (raster)
      render pass: colour output: clear (0, 0, 0, 1), store
  end of frame
    barrier output: color-attachment-write -> present
